WEBVTT

00:11:25.889 --> 00:11:31.103
You have the power to have an enormous
impact on their brain development.

00:11:31.145 --> 00:11:34.565
You are helping build the network
of neural connections

00:11:34.606 --> 00:11:37.901
that lay the foundation
for all of their future learning.

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:40.696
So this week at bath time,

00:11:40.738 --> 00:11:44.408
I hope that you'll put aside
the top-rated toys,

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:47.494
forget that mental
to-do list for a moment,

00:11:47.536 --> 00:11:49.163
grab some measuring cups,

00:11:49.204 --> 00:11:52.249
some kitchen sponges, and give it a try.

00:11:52.291 --> 00:11:53.459
Thank you.

00:11:53.459 --> 00:11:56.044
(Applause)